## Goal
Perform principal component analysis (PCA) on the gene expression counts to visualize sample relationships in two-dimensional space, with points colored by experimental condition (untreated vs. treated). This shows whether samples cluster by condition and identifies the primary sources of variance in the data.

## Inputs
Artifact types resolve through each sub-stage's OUTPUTS.tsv at execution time; the paths
below are what they resolve to today.

| Artifact type | Resolved from | Path |
